# Git and change safety

- Never discard unrelated uncommitted work; never reset/rebase/force-push unless explicitly requested.
- Do not push or deploy unless James explicitly asks.
- Do not amend commits except under user-rule conditions.
- Prefer small, scoped commits; ask before committing.
- Do not modify production resources, send live client emails, or mutate prod data unless explicitly authorized in-session.
- Keep BookDirect / marketing site dirty trees separate from Owner Ops governance commits.
